WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:05.779
From a grizzly blood bath to flying French
body parts, "Prey" offers up some of the "Predator"

00:00:05.779 --> 00:00:07.999
franchise's most gruesome kills.

00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:09.750
Spoilers ahead.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.620
While the famous alien hunter is known by
the name "Predator," it's merely a reference

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.299
to what it does for sport.

00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:16.490
It hunts.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:20.850
The species, however, only hunt other predators,
animals that can fight back.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.320
Otherwise, there's no sport in the affair.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:27.359
Being new to planet Earth in this film, the
Predator begins hunting wildlife.

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:28.929
It first kills a rattlesnake.

00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:31.330
It even eventually kills a massive grizzly
bear.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.110
But at one point, however, it targets a wolf.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:38.200
Just like with its human prey, the Predator
stalks the wolf using thermal vision.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.110
However, the wolf is only out to get lunch,
eying a tasty-looking rabbit.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:47.190
After the wolf gives chase, it nabs the furry
snack right as the Predator strikes.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.100
The two predators then spar, with the alien
hunter getting the better of the canine.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:55.149
Later in the film, the alien hunter is seen
polishing the wolf's skull.

00:00:55.149 --> 00:00:59.519
It's a clear callback to the Predators' tendency
to claim trophies.

00:00:59.519 --> 00:01:04.350
One of the most harrowing moments in the film
comes when Naru encounters a grizzly bear.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:09.320
The animal, in all of its ferocity, sets its
sights on Naru and aims to kill her.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.220
Naru flees and spots a beaver dam in the middle
of the river.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:16.340
She dives underneath the water's surface and
pulls herself up inside the fortified beaver

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.340
home.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:21.830
Meanwhile, the Predator hones in on the massive
bear intent on collecting another trophy.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:26.200
The Predator is strong enough to pull its
kill from out of the dam and hoist the massive

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.970
mammal over its head.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:33.780
Naru stares in terror as the cloaked predator
lets the animal's blood pour over its body.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.670
It's a powerful, iconic moment for the franchise.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:41.040
Perhaps one of Naru's biggest detractors,
Wasape, leads the hunting party with all the

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.750
bravado he can muster.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.670
He has zero faith that Naru can be an effective
hunter with his snide comments.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.240
"Who invited you?

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:52.390
We won't be gone long enough to need a cook."

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:57.530
It was always clear from the get-go that Wasape's
ego was going to get him into trouble and

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.160
lead to his demise.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:03.140
When the Comanche hunting party hears strange
sounds in the woods, they become wary.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.650
A creature is making guttural clicking noises
high in the trees, but they're unsure what

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:09.530
sort of animal it could be.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:13.340
After Wasape kills a possum thinking it was
causing the rustling in the woods, he goes

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.500
to retrieve it.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.240
That's when three red dots appear on his chest.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:21.060
He is swiftly killed with three darts shortly
after.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:24.720
Like most of us have come to expect, there's
a moment when the Comanche hunters face a

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.130
mass slaughter at the hands of the predator.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:31.000
The moment comes after the hunters embark
on a trip to track down Naru.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.190
She's left camp to hunt and investigate this
strange new visitor on her own.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:39.640
"If they don't see, I will show them."

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:44.450
While on the prowl for the lion earlier, Naru
insists to Taabe that they aren't alone in

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:45.450
the forest.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:49.590
Her senses are keen as she notes the oddly
skinned snake from earlier.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:53.880
After finding an injured fellow hunter who
was attacked by the mountain lion, Naru rightfully

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.650
wonders why the mountain lion didn't finish
him off.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.350
She postulates to her brother that something
scared it away.

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:03.900
Furthermore, the native hunters suggest the
tracks left behind are from a bear, though

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:08.440
Naru correctly points out that the tracks
indicate an animal walking on its hind legs.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:13.460
Unknown to the warriors, the Predator watches
and waits for the right moment to strike.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.930
After killing Wasape, the rest of the hunters
jump in to attack.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.160
Fighting this hulking beast one-on-one is
a bad call, however.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:24.800
No matter how skilled these warriors are,
their abilities are no match for the physical

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.180
prowess of the Predator.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.290
It begins systematically butchering them one
by one.

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:33.240
It's a bloody sequence that sets a precedent
for the massacre of the fur trappers still

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.310
to come.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:39.340
Itsee is a member of Taabe's band of Comanche
hunters who initially endeavors to slay a

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.459
mountain lion.

00:03:40.459 --> 00:03:43.930
In the battle sequence where the Predator
rears its ugly head and slaughters nearly

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:47.440
the entire hunting party, Itsee is nowhere
to be seen.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:51.780
After Naru flees from the alien hunter she
finds herself in a field of tall grass.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:56.430
Itsee grabs her and pulls her below the grass
and motions to her to be silent.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.790
Itsee indicates that he can see the beast.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:02.990
Steadying his bow, a trio of targeting lasers
appears on his forehead.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:06.970
Naru, knowing exactly what that means, is
quick on the draw and causes the Predator

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.620
to miss his shot.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:13.460
Naru only buys poor Itsee precious seconds,
however, as the Predator gives chase.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:17.090
Still invisible, following them through the
tall grass, the Predator closes in.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:22.560
The creature runs Itsee down in the field
and guts him in a grisly display.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:26.720
After the Predator has eviscerated most of
the Comanche hunting party, the fur trappers

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.940
remain, alongside Naru and Taabe, of course.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:34.460
The fur trappers attempt to use Naru and Taabe
as bait for the alien hunter by tying them

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.460
to a tree.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:39.430
However, Naru knows from experience that the
Predator won't target her and her brother

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.600
while they're incapacitated.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:44.400
Instead, it's going to hunt all the fur trappers
lying in wait.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.010
Of course, what ensues is a massive slaughter
of the fur trappers.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:52.870
The Predator actively uses all of its tools
and moves, dismembering the hunters left and

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:53.870
right.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:57.740
At one point, it chokeholds a man to a tree
and then activates its gauntlet shield that

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.630
opens up and decapitates the man.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:04.010
It even wields the weapons brought by the
fur traders, including an ax, and lobs off

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.740
another man's arm before finishing the job.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.510
One unfortunate soul aims his pistol directly
at the Predator point blank.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:13.640
The Predator stands still as if to beckoning
the man to fire.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.639
When he finally pulls the trigger, the bullet
ricochets off the Predator's helmet and brings

00:05:17.639 --> 00:05:19.590
a swift end to the trapper.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:24.449
The Predator ends his massacre by leaving
behind a wrist gauntlet containing three explosive

00:05:24.449 --> 00:05:27.270
drones that eliminate the rest of their party.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:32.360
"Raphael Adolini" is the name inscribed on
the flintlock pistol the Predators gave to

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.430
Detective Mike Harrigan at the end of "Predator
2."

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:39.770
It was a cool nod to the idea that the crew
of alien hunters had been visiting Earth for

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.080
a few centuries.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:45.880
That very flintlock pistol becomes a key tie-in
to the prequel film "Prey."

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:50.350
Credited only as "Raphael," he is one of the
trappers who initially finds and imprisons

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.390
Naru after she is snagged by their bear trap.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:57.490
While imprisoned at their camp, Raphael is
the only one who speaks her language and can

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.830
translate for the other fur trappers.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:04.250
The only thing they want to know is any details
she can share on the beast that is hunting

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.250
them.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.169
Later in the film, all of the fur trappers
are slaughtered by the Predator.

00:06:08.169 --> 00:06:11.440
One lone trapper makes it back alive: Raphael.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.770
Though his leg is severed below the knee.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.690
He asks for Naru's help in exchange for his
flintlock pistol.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:21.400
Unfortunately, when the Predator arrives,
it finds the incapacitated Adolini is still

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.870
alive and finishes what it started.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:28.960
Adolini may have been a random fur trapper,
but his flintlock pistol is a cool relic that

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.710
connects the great Predator universe.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:36.680
Perhaps one of the most emotionally upsetting
deaths at the hands of the Predator is Taabe,

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:37.680
Naru's brother.

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:41.490
While he displays a measure of doubt about
his sister's hunting skills, it's more likely

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:43.500
that he is being protective of her.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.010
However, he does ultimately relent and allows
her to join the hunt.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:51.370
During their trek, Naru shares her anxieties
over another hunter in the woods given the

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:55.770
strangely skinned snake and the odd attack
patterns she is tracking from animals in the

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:56.770
wilderness.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:00.830
Taabe dismisses Naru's instincts, however,
a move he won't soon forget.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:05.680
Of the entire Comanche hunting party, Taabe
manages to outlast them all, standing strong

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.490
right beside his sister.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:11.759
When Naru is attacked by the Predator in the
fur trappers' camp, Taabe jumps into the fray

00:07:11.759 --> 00:07:14.840
with Naru, making one final request of her.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.760
"This is it."

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.760
"No"

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.320
"Bring it home."

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:23.330
It's a loving message for her to finish the
job knowing he won't survive combat with the

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.330
beast.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:28.840
The Predator does get the better of him and
impales Taabe through the back with its wrist-mounted

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:29.840
claws.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:33.790
When the Predator targets Naru, Taabe, who
is seemingly dead, gets one final blow and

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:37.890
injures the alien hunter's leg, but meets
his end as a result.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:42.160
This fuels her motivation to end the Predator
once and for all.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:46.380
No matter how ferocious the Predator may be,
the odds are stacked against it when it comes

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:47.889
to surviving the film.

00:07:47.889 --> 00:07:51.039
But it's not brute strength that gives humans
an advantage.

00:07:51.039 --> 00:07:53.990
A fight with the Predator comes down to a
game of wits.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:58.919
Every human victor always bests the alien
by outsmarting it at its own game.

00:07:58.919 --> 00:08:00.580
Naru is a master at this.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:05.070
Early in the film, she is temporarily trapped
in a bog but manages to pull herself to safety

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.919
using her ax and rope.

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:11.470
As the final confrontation approaches, Naru
uses her flintlock pistol to knock the Predator's

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.740
mask off, robbing it of its targeting system.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.759
She takes the mask and positions it to aim
at the bog.

00:08:17.759 --> 00:08:21.420
She intends to pull the Predator into the
mire where the creature will be forced to

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.509
shoot at her from a distance.

00:08:23.509 --> 00:08:28.220
However, its weaponry is guided by the mask's
targeting system when active.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:32.210
Once the Predator does fall for her trap and
makes the fatal mistake of pulling the trigger,

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:37.169
the bolt bends away from Naru and ricochets
off multiple trees before plunging right through

00:08:37.169 --> 00:08:38.380
the Predator's skull.

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:41.809
In effect, she tricks the beast into killing
itself.

00:08:41.809 --> 00:08:45.470
This time, the human victor takes a trophy
from the Predator, something that hasn't happened

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.769
in previous films.

00:08:46.769 --> 00:08:51.450
As she walks back into her camp, it's clear
that Naru has become as vicious as the alien

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.649
beast that stalked her.

